{"id":2319,"date":"2026-08-27T16:26:13","date_gmt":"2026-08-27T16:26:13","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/?post_type=knowledgebase&#038;p=2319"},"modified":"2026-08-27T16:54:36","modified_gmt":"2026-08-27T16:54:36","slug":"hyperlinks","status":"publish","type":"knowledgebase","link":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/db\/typography\/hyperlinks\/","title":{"rendered":"Hyperlinks"},"content":{"rendered":"<div style=\"color: #2b2b2b;\">\n<h2 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Hyperlinks<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-2328\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Hyperlinks.webp\" alt=\"Hyperlinks\" width=\"118\" height=\"125\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Hyperlinks.webp 902w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Hyperlinks-285x300.webp 285w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Hyperlinks-768x810.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 118px) 100vw, 118px\" \/><\/span><\/h2>\n<p class=\"western\">Open Publisher allows you to easily embed clickable web links into your text boxes and table cells. Hyperlink management is built directly into the right-click context menu, making it fast and contextual to use while editing.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Adding a Hyperlink<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-2324\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/AddHyperlink.webp\" alt=\"Adding a Hyperlink\" width=\"142\" height=\"368\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/AddHyperlink.webp 275w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/AddHyperlink-116x300.webp 116w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 142px) 100vw, 142px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Highlight the text you want to turn into a link.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Right-click the highlighted text and select <strong>Add Hyperlink<\/strong> from the context menu.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">A prompt will appear. Enter your destination URL and confirm to apply the link instantly.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Removing a Hyperlink<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-2323\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/RemoveHyperlink.webp\" alt=\"Removing a Hyperlink\" width=\"150\" height=\"389\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/RemoveHyperlink.webp 275w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/RemoveHyperlink-116x300.webp 116w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">If you need to remove a link but want to keep the text exactly as it is, you can strip the hyperlink routing safely without deleting the words:<\/p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Right-click directly on the existing link (or make a text selection that contains the link).<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Select <strong>Remove Hyperlink<\/strong> from the context menu.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p class=\"western\">The link routing will be instantly removed while perfectly preserving your original text.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Intelligent Context Menu<\/span><\/h3>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-1450\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ContexMenus.webp\" alt=\"Intelligent Context Menu\" width=\"115\" height=\"175\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ContexMenus.webp 615w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ContexMenus-197x300.webp 197w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 115px) 100vw, 115px\" \/><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">The right-click menu is context-aware. It smartly toggles between showing <strong>Add Hyperlink<\/strong> (when standard, unlinked text is selected) and <strong>Remove Hyperlink<\/strong> (when you right-click an existing link), ensuring your menu remains clean and relevant to the action you want to perform.<\/p>\n<p class=\"western\">All hyperlink actions are also fully integrated with the document history system, allowing you to use <strong>Undo<\/strong> and <strong>Redo<\/strong> if you make a mistake.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Hyperlinks Open Publisher allows you to easily embed clickable web links into your text boxes and table cells. Hyperlink management is built directly into the right-click context menu, making it fast and contextual to use while editing. Adding a Hyperlink Highlight the text you want to turn into a link. Right-click the highlighted text and [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":2328,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","knowledgebase_cat":[11],"class_list":["post-2319","knowledgebase","type-knowledgebase","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","knowledgebase_cat-typography"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/2319","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/knowledgebase"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=2319"}],"version-history":[{"count":6,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/2319\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":2331,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/2319\/revisions\/2331"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/2328"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=2319"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"knowledgebase_cat","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase_cat?post=2319"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}